- Turunkan senjata kalian! Turunkan!

1195
01:46:03,458 --> 01:46:04,875
Hentikan.

1196
01:46:06,375 --> 01:46:09,625
Kami akan meletakkan senjata.
Ayo… Ayo bicara.

1197
01:46:09,708 --> 01:46:13,375
Pergi dari sini,
nanti dia kuturunkan di perbatasan.

1198
01:46:13,458 --> 01:46:15,416
Kau tahu itu tidak bisa, Sam.

1199
01:46:15,958 --> 01:46:17,208
Kalian tidak lihat?

1200
01:46:17,791 --> 01:46:20,708
Kalian tidak bisa membunuhku!

1201
01:46:21,250 --> 01:46:23,916
Aku dewa bagi banyak orang!

1202
01:46:24,625 --> 01:46:28,500
Dia punya mata-mata!
Dia punya kaki tangan! Dia punya penjaga!

1203
01:46:30,625 --> 01:46:34,000
Steel Selamanya. Selamanya Steel!

1204
01:46:36,416 --> 01:46:38,750
Maju! Cepat! Maju!

1205
01:46:42,125 --> 01:46:44,083
Polly, balik badan!

1206
01:46:46,833 --> 01:46:47,833
Balik badan.

1207
01:48:56,208 --> 01:48:57,208
Kau sudah siap?

1208
01:49:00,958 --> 01:49:01,791
Maya.

1209
01:49:01,875 --> 01:49:04,666
John. Hai. Bagaimana kabarmu hari ini?

1210
01:49:04,750 --> 01:49:06,750
- Baik. Terima kasih.
- Bagus.

1211
01:49:08,333 --> 01:49:09,416
Dia bagaimana?

1212
01:49:10,083 --> 01:49:11,083
Sangat baik.

1213
01:49:12,000 --> 01:49:12,833
Ya.

1214
01:49:12,916 --> 01:49:14,416
- Senang bertemu.
- Terima kasih.

1215
01:49:15,041 --> 01:49:16,250
Hai.

1216
01:49:16,333 --> 01:49:18,833
Polly. Ini Maya.

1217
01:49:19,250 --> 01:49:20,458
Maya, ini Polly.

1218
01:49:20,541 --> 01:49:22,166
Senang bertemu, Polly.

1219
01:49:22,708 --> 01:49:25,833
Hai. Mau memelukku?

1220
01:49:28,375 --> 01:49:30,375
Boleh? Ya.

1221
01:49:32,166 --> 01:49:33,291
Selamat datang.

1222
01:49:37,000 --> 01:49:38,000
Masuklah.

1223
01:49:42,541 --> 01:49:46,583
Kami sangat bersyukur
kau menjadi anggota keluarga kami, Polly.

1224
01:49:46,666 --> 01:49:48,916
Banyak orang akan berkata, misalnya,

1225
01:49:49,000 --> 01:49:52,375
"Ini saudara angkatku."

1226
01:49:52,458 --> 01:49:54,500
Istilah itu tidak ada di rumah ini.

1227
01:49:54,583 --> 01:49:57,833
Mereka semua saudaramu. Kita keluarga.

1228
01:50:00,458 --> 01:50:03,958
Aku akan bawa tasmu ke kamarmu.

1229
01:50:04,416 --> 01:50:06,375
Buatlah dirimu nyaman di sini.

1230
01:50:07,500 --> 01:50:08,708
Sebentar kita makan.

1231
01:50:08,791 --> 01:50:10,375
Bawa sini jaketmu, Sayang.

1232
01:50:16,583 --> 01:50:18,541
- Kemarikan, John.
- Terima kasih.

1233
01:50:18,625 --> 01:50:20,041
Sama-sama.

1234
01:50:26,625 --> 01:50:28,500
Kalau butuh apa-apa, hubungi aku.

1235
01:50:37,041 --> 01:50:38,125
Terima kasih, Maya.

1236
01:50:38,208 --> 01:50:40,875
Ya. Sampai nanti, John.

1237
01:50:47,208 --> 01:50:48,500
Baiklah.

1238
01:50:48,916 --> 01:50:50,125
Ayo.

1239
01:50:50,541 --> 01:50:53,416
Hei, Anak-Anak. Ayo sapa Polly.

1240
01:50:53,500 --> 01:50:54,708
- Hai, Polly.
- Hei, Polly.

1241
01:50:54,791 --> 01:50:56,750
- Hai, Polly.
- Buat dia nyaman di sini.

1242
01:50:59,958 --> 01:51:01,833
- Ini seru sekali!
- Ya, 'kan?

1243
01:51:01,916 --> 01:51:05,125
- Ini seru. Aku suka tarian ini.
- Angkat tanganmu.

1244
01:51:09,291 --> 01:51:10,291
Ya.

1245
01:51:11,833 --> 01:51:13,000
Kau bisa menari?

1246
01:51:15,083 --> 01:51:16,583
Ayo, yang ini gampang.

1247
01:51:20,250 --> 01:51:22,833
- Selanjutnya lagu apa?
- Mungkin yang ini.

1248
01:51:38,625 --> 01:51:40,666
Pakai tanganmu.

1249
01:51:41,375 --> 01:51:43,041
Mau melakukan gerakan pertama?

1250
01:51:51,625 --> 01:51:53,500
Gerakan pertamanya adalah…

1251
01:51:54,791 --> 01:51:58,541
Rentangkan kakimu, lalu sekaligus begini.

1252
01:52:05,208 --> 01:52:06,250
Lalu ulangi.

1253
01:52:10,166 --> 01:52:11,208
Bisa?

1254
01:59:56,166 --> 01:59:58,166
Terjemahan subtitle oleh June Arya

1255
01:59:58,250 --> 02:00:00,250
Supervisor Kreasi Kiki Alek